BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Breaking Free from Low Mood and Depression
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260906T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260906T173000
UID:176f6ac2185fb7f69233979c@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this 8-week course\, based on the Mindfulness Based Cogniti
 ve Therapy programme\, we’ll explore how to stay well\, and sustain posi
 tive mental health.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/breaking-free-from-low-m
 ood-and-depression-sep-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Urban Retreat 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260912T213000
UID:f4cb3de513349701183c6aba@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:How much can we change our mind in one week? The Urban Retreat
  is a chance to find out. For seven days\, the LBC's usual programme becom
 es something altogether more intensive – a series of special events desi
 gned to create the immersive\, transformative conditions of a retreat with
 out leaving the city. All are welcome\, sign up for free on our website.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Morning Meditation
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T070000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T080000
UID:00cfb86cacb66913452b3d0c@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Start your day meditating with others. Come in person if you c
 an\, or join online. After meditation\, stay for breakfast in the LBC.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-morni
 ng-meditation-tue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tibetan Yoga (Kum Nye)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T100000
UID:12617789260206c499c02ff2@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Kum Nye is a Tibetan movement practice\, similar to tai chi or
  yoga. This session explores simple exercises using movement\, breath and 
 awareness to release tension and develop a deeper sense of ease in both bo
 dy and mind. No prior experience needed.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-kum-n
 ye-tue
END:VEVENT
