BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Qigong
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260915T183000
UID:c8a5258f11114c0efffd7203@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Qigong (pronounced "chee-gong") is a system of exercises which
  helps us cultivate awareness and connect with our bodies through simple b
 reathing exercises and movement techniques\, and can be a great way to pre
 pare for meditation. Join us for a beginner-friendly session. No experienc
 e necessary.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/urban-retreat-2026-qigon
 g-tue
END:VEVENT
